# QtCreator's shared user-file directory - the alternative to a .user file next
# to each CMakeLists.txt. Ignoring the directory rather than the names inside it:
# what Qt Creator writes there is its business, and today's contents stay out of
# `git status` only by accident, by matching CMakeLists.txt.user* and *.pro.user.
.qtcreator/

# QtCreator Qml
*.qmlproject.user
*.qmlproject.user.*

# QtCreator CMake
CMakeLists.txt.user*

# QtCreator 4.8< compilation database
compile_commands.json

# QtCreator local machine specific files for imported projects
*creator.user*

*_qmlcache.qrc

# others
.idea
.vscode
bak
build

# Example runtime perspective folders (written when examples run from the source tree)
persist/
perspectives/

# aqtinstall (written to the CWD when installing Qt for WebAssembly)
aqtinstall.log

# Python bytecode (conanfile.py, helper scripts)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Coverage and static analysis output (CI uploads these as artifacts)
coverage*.info
clang-tidy.log
tidy-files.txt

# AI assistant workspace (local only)
.workbuddy/
